{
 "_doc": "Speicher-Register (Fabian 09.10.2026: Fehlerquellen ohne Zufallsbefund finden). Every localStorage key of the app is listed here. cat: restore = Kunden-/Test-Modus snapshot puts it back (must match HO_SNAP_RE in app.js); keep = deliberately not restored (presets, history which addHistory() diverts, hints, mode bookkeeping); test = test switch only. backup: false = in BACKUP_EXCLUDE. A new key needs an entry here, speicher_register_0910_test.py checks app.js and live localStorage against it.",
